{"about_the_game":"The main character is a young adventurer named Edward Graves. He boards his ship and sets sail alone, following an old map that everyone considers mythical. After a dangerous voyage and a long search, he reaches an island. Among the rocks and ancient chests of gold, he meets Scarlett Morgan. She is a woman who has been trapped by these riches for a long time and has survived there at the cost of loneliness.<br><br>A connection flares up between them, starting out cautious and wary but soon growing into passion. Edward must now choose whether to continue the race for gold and risk losing himself or admit that he has already found the true treasure.<br><br>Will he resist the temptation of cursed riches, or succumb to a much more human temptation?<br><br>Game features:<br><strong>\u2022 An adventure story with a pirate atmosphere.<br>\u2022 Characters with secrets, personality, and charisma.<br>\u2022 A story where gold and passion intertwine.<br>\u2022 An atmosphere of romance, humor, and candid scenes.<br>\u2022 A cinematic presentation that makes every event vivid and memorable.</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064570?t=1768548113","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064570/3fe44a79c62870938592334539616e15e46a6d57/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768548113","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064570/ace633d402bf63ac16dcec6b177921bc16b1b2c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768548113","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064570/ace633d402bf63ac16dcec6b177921bc16b1b2c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768548113","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"not